  <h2>Rhizome Springs, Saltspring Island BC</h2>

  <p>Kin-Fusion Campout 2026 takes place at <a href="https://www.rhizomesprings.com/">Rhizome Springs</a>, a stunning retreat and gathering space nestled in the natural beauty of Saltspring Island, British Columbia.</p>

  <div class="location-photos">
    {% image "night dome 4.jpeg", "The open-air dome at Rhizome Springs illuminated at night under the stars", {} %}
  </div>

  <h2>Getting There</h2>

  <p>Saltspring Island is accessible by BC Ferries from Vancouver (Tsawwassen &rarr; Long Harbour) and from Victoria (Swartz Bay &rarr; Fulford Harbour). The island is also reachable by floatplane from Vancouver or Seattle.</p>

  <p>More detailed travel information will be posted as the event approaches.</p>

